---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service - SmallTextGen | Free Unicode Text Tool"
  description="The terms of use for SmallTextGen, a free online small text generator. Covers acceptable use, content ownership, third-party links, disclaimers, and contact information."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.small-text-gen.com/terms/"
>
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-50/90 backdrop-blur-md dark:border-zinc-800/80 dark:bg-zinc-950/90">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl items-center justify-between px-4 py-3">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-semibold text-lg tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
        <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent-600 text-white text-sm font-bold">s</span>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline">SmallTextGen</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="text-sm font-medium text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400 dark:hover:text-accent-300">Back to Generator</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pt-16 pb-16">
    <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Last updated: September 29, 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Using SmallTextGen</h2>
        <p>SmallTextGen is a free, browser-based small text generator. You can use the tool and everything it produces for personal and commercial projects — social media bios, gaming nicknames, documents, branding, and products — without attribution or a license fee.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p>The generator is provided for creating and converting text. Please use it the way you would want others to use their names and accounts: impersonation, spam, and deceptive uses are prohibited by the platforms themselves, and their content rules apply wherever you paste small text.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Your Content</h2>
        <p>Text you type into SmallTextGen is processed entirely in your browser and never transmitted to our servers. You keep all rights to the text you create, including any styled output you copy from the tool. The underlying characters are part of the Unicode Standard and are free for anyone to use.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Our Content</h2>
        <p>The website design, original guide text, and tool interface are &copy; SmallTextGen. Individual Unicode characters and the Unicode Standard documentation referenced on this site belong to the Unicode Consortium.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>Pages on this site link to independent resources such as the <a href="https://www.unicode.org/versions/Unicode17.0.0/" rel="noopener" class="text-accent-600 hover:underline">Unicode Consortium</a> and reference articles. Those sites have their own terms and privacy practices, and we are not responsible for their content.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Disclaimers</h2>
        <p>The tool is provided as-is, with no warranty of uninterrupted availability. Because small text relies on each app&apos;s font support, rendering can vary by platform and device — checking a style in the target app before publishing a bio or nickname is always worth a moment. Questions about how a character renders are best answered by a quick paste test.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>If we update these terms, the &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page will change. Continued use of the site after an update means the new terms apply.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms? Write to <a href="mailto:hello@small-text-gen.com" class="text-accent-600 hover:underline">hello@small-text-gen.com</a> or use the <a href="/contact/" class="text-accent-600 hover:underline">contact page</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-zinc-200 bg-white py-8 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/50">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-3xl flex-col items-center gap-4 px-4 text-center sm:flex-row sm:justify-between">
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">&copy; 2026 SmallTextGen. Built and maintained by the SmallTextGen team.</p>
      <nav class="flex gap-6 text-xs text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">
        <a href="/privacy/" class="hover:text-zinc-600 dark:hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms/" class="hover:text-zinc-600 dark:hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors">Terms</a>
        <a href="/about/" class="hover:text-zinc-600 dark:hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors">About</a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="hover:text-zinc-600 dark:hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
